{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"scene-reading","type":"group","x":0,"y":9180,"width":2160,"height":2360,"color":"6","label":"C4f | Shared Tarokka reading | Only if the party accepts the task"},
		{"id":"scene-tales","type":"group","x":0,"y":2980,"width":2160,"height":1420,"color":"2","label":"C4d | Tales | Player stories interleaved, not an NPC monologue"},
		{"id":"scene-crossroads","type":"group","x":0,"y":7680,"width":2160,"height":1420,"color":"5","label":"C4e | Crossroads | Eva, possible pursuit, March of the Dead"},
		{"id":"scene-vision","type":"group","x":0,"y":6440,"width":2160,"height":1160,"color":"6","label":"IF off-road concealment | Wolf vision | Then resume real positions"},
		{"id":"scene-game","type":"group","x":0,"y":1840,"width":2160,"height":1060,"color":"2","label":"C4d | Game of Stories | Invitations and flexible interludes"},
		{"id":"scene-road","type":"group","x":0,"y":5300,"width":2160,"height":1060,"color":"5","label":"C4e | Leave for the crossroads | Eliza may follow"},
		{"id":"scene-camp","type":"group","x":0,"y":820,"width":2160,"height":940,"color":"2","label":"C4d | Back at the fire | Welcome and dinner"},
		{"id":"scene-guide","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":2160,"height":740,"color":"5","label":"SESSION 9 | DM ONLY | How to use this board"},
		{"id":"scene-arturi","type":"group","x":0,"y":4480,"width":2160,"height":740,"color":"2","label":"C4d | Arturi leaves | Investigation is conditional"},
		{"id":"scene-morning","type":"group","x":0,"y":11620,"width":2160,"height":720,"color":"4","label":"STRETCH | C4g | Back at Tser Pool, the following morning"},
		{"id":"scene-rider","type":"group","x":0,"y":12420,"width":2160,"height":800,"color":"4","label":"STRETCH | C5 | On a return to the crossroads after the reading"},
		{"id":"guide-use","type":"text","text":"# Session 9 running board\n**Down = later beats, not equal amounts of time.** Read across for the same moment.\n\nFive lanes: **Time | Weather | Location | NPCs | DM alerts**. Blank space means no new cue, not missing preparation.\n\nDouble-click to edit; drag cards to move; drag edges to resize. Select a scene: **Shift+2** frames it; **Shift+1** fits all. Command palette: **Canvas: Jump to group**.\n\nNPC subcards marked THROUGHOUT are simultaneous, not later arrivals or a speaking queue.\n\nSummaries are independent of their linked sources. Manual edits stay here; source changes do not auto-refresh.","x":40,"y":60,"width":800,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"guide-scope","type":"text","text":"## Start and scope\n**Logged:** at the Tser Pool fire after meeting Eliza and Arturi. Personal readings already happened. Arturi asked about Van Richten; the party said no.\n\n**Core:** C4d-C4f. **Stretch:** C4g/C5. No C6.\n\n[[sessions/Session 8/log#Madam Eva|Played history]]\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#1. Scope|Session scope]]","x":860,"y":60,"width":620,"height":300},
		{"id":"guide-labels","type":"text","text":"## Labels and sources\n**IF** = branch, not inevitable. **CHECK** = exact trigger/procedure. **TELL PLAYER** = report the observable cue, not its secret cause.\n\n**UNRESOLVED** = needs a DM decision. **OPEN PREP** = execution or rehearsal is incomplete. **OPTIONAL ATMOSPHERE** = suggested delivery, not adopted fact.\n\nScene source cards cover nearby summaries; special rules/decisions have their own links. Full tales/readings stay in the source.","x":40,"y":390,"width":800,"height":290},
		{"id":"guide-open","type":"text","text":"## Before running\n**UNRESOLVED:** Arc C calls Eliza a **bandit**; prepared Foundry actor is a **Spy**. Confirm which to run; do not silently add Spy actions.\n\n**OPEN PREP:** wolf counter/early-end procedure, exact companion/sense positions, post-wolf Eliza resolution, transition controls, rehearsals. Map/actors are DM-confirmed done; this does not close the other tasks.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Q38 - Off-road wolf-pack vision (DM-only)|Q38 design]] / [[sessions/Session 9/prep#Q38 - Wolf vision assets|Assets]]","x":860,"y":390,"width":620,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"guide-senses","type":"text","text":"## DM: Agni's Blood Sense\n**Check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Thirsty: always on, unsuppressible. Composed: bonus action, 1 minute. Sated: action, 10 minutes.\n\nWithin **30 ft**, including total cover/invisibility: report living creatures' exact locations, bloodied status, and which has lowest current HP. Not appearance/identity; not sight or automatic party surprise.\n\nTrack entry/exit using actual positions. Unknown activation stays conditional. Per-scene candidates below are not preset detections.\n\n[[players/agni/vampire_details#Blood Sense|Feature]] / [[players/agni/vampire_details#Stages|Stages]]","x":1500,"y":60,"width":620,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"guide-urn","type":"text","text":"## DM: Elga's Urn / table boundaries\n**Elga's Urn glows: tell the player** whenever actual undead are within **300 ft**, even hidden. Bright purple. PCs never trigger it. Recheck if the party moves or splits.\n\n**UNRESOLVED IF TRIGGERED:** Blood Frenzy attacking a PC must be checked against Session 0's prior in-character PvP consent; do not silently force it.\n\n[[players/sister_elga/soul_gathering#Urn of Soulcatching|Urn]] / [[sessions/Session 0/campaign_rules_expectations#Player Conflict (PvP)|PvP boundary]]","x":1500,"y":440,"width":620,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"camp-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":860,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"camp-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":860,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"camp-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":860,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"camp-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":860,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"camp-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":860,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"camp-time","type":"text","text":"### Dusk\nDaylight giving way to firelight.\n\n**DM calendar:** Neyavr 1, 735 B.C.\n\nNo fixed dinner duration.\n\nMidnight meeting already promised.","x":40,"y":950,"width":180,"height":330},
		{"id":"camp-weather","type":"text","text":"### Beyond the fire\nDusk: ambient light fades.\n\n**OPTIONAL ATMOSPHERE:** a cool draft at the back contrasts with the fire's warmth. No cold penalty.","x":240,"y":950,"width":220,"height":290},
		{"id":"camp-location","type":"text","text":"### Dinner around the fire\n- Bright campfire; warmth on the face.\n- Smell of rabbit stew and flatbread.\n\n**Background Vistani | OPTIONAL ATMOSPHERE**\n- Throughout dinner: quiet conversations of their own; occasional laughter across the fire.\n- Passing bowls; tearing bread; leaning toward the coals.\n\n**Closer details**\n- Stew: rabbit, potatoes, turnips, lentils, parsnips; flatbread alongside.\n- A Vistana occasionally tends the fire, nudging logs into place.\n- **OPTIONAL ATMOSPHERE:** steam above bowls; smoke clinging to wool.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4d. The Dancing Fire|Full scene]]","x":480,"y":950,"width":360,"height":590},
		{"id":"camp-eliza","type":"text","text":"### Eliza\nCheery, excitable; brash/witty interruptions.\n\nAsks where the party goes next.\n\n**DM-only:** gathering goals, capabilities, weaknesses for Strahd.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4c. Vistani Hospitality|Profile]]","x":860,"y":950,"width":300,"height":330},
		{"id":"camp-arturi","type":"text","text":"### Arturi\nQuiet, soft-spoken, distant; painfully sincere.\n\nVan Richten question already asked: do not restart it.\n\nIf pressed on his interest, the acquaintance/rumor cover story remains available.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4c. Vistani Hospitality|Profile]]","x":1180,"y":950,"width":300,"height":330},
		{"id":"camp-stanimir","type":"text","text":"### Stanimir\n**THROUGHOUT dinner, alongside the NPCs above.**\nAmused, welcoming host.\n\nOffers overnight rest; the party uses its own tents, with accommodation if needed.\n\nWarns of dangerous roads, not a compulsory stay.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q14 decision; C4d]]","x":860,"y":1310,"width":300,"height":370},
		{"id":"camp-company","type":"text","text":"### Ireena / camp company\n**THROUGHOUT dinner, not later arrivals.**\nIreena is with the party. The healed blue-tipped raven accompanied them here; do not assume it vanished.\n\n**Eight unnamed Vistani:** two will tell stories; six remain grouped background company.\n\n[[sessions/Session 8/log#Strix|Raven history]]","x":1180,"y":1310,"width":300,"height":370},
		{"id":"camp-alert-history","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: don't replay introductions\nArturi's first Van Richten question is history. **Only if the rumor cover story is used:** requested Wisdom (Insight) **DC 10** notices hurried speech; he does not confess when challenged.\n\nNever invite Insight unprompted. Players first ask about behavior/truthfulness.\n\nArturi usually leaves at dusk, but C4d explicitly has him linger through tonight's game, then leave. Do not assign each tale a clock time.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4d. The Dancing Fire|Checks and timing]]","x":1500,"y":950,"width":620,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"camp-alert-senses","type":"text","text":"### SENSES: fire scenes, including game/tales\n**Urn:** no scene-introduced undead here. Recheck if actual undead approach within 300 ft; Arturi is living, not undead because of his curse.\n\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Candidates within 30 ft: Stanimir, Eliza, Arturi, unnamed Vistani, Ireena, the living raven, other living companions. Exact seating/HP unknown: track actual positions and entry/exit, not identities through the sense.\n\nThese warnings persist through the game and tales unless someone moves.","x":1500,"y":1310,"width":620,"height":370,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"game-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":1880,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"game-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":1880,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"game-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":1880,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"game-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":1880,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"game-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":1880,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"game-time","type":"text","text":"### After dinner\nGive players a few minutes away from the table to plan stories.\n\nNot a fixed countdown to midnight.","x":40,"y":1970,"width":180,"height":270},
		{"id":"game-location","type":"text","text":"### Same fire, new focus\nWagers gather in the pot.\n\n**TABLE PROP:** ordinary playing cards for Stanimir's worn deck; save the real Tarokka deck for Eva.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4d. The Dancing Fire|Game and wagers]]","x":480,"y":1970,"width":360,"height":290},
		{"id":"game-wagers","type":"text","text":"### Invitation & wagers\n**Game:** wager a small object; tell a moving story; guess True / False / Half-True. Most correct guesses wins the pot.\n\n**Wagers:** Stanimir: late wife's deck; Eliza: brass corner-viewing spyglass; Arturi: Van Richten's two-page werewolf manuscript; Ireena: sunflower hairclip. **DM-added:** first teller: brass pocket mirror etched with a winding road and stars; second: little wooden bird with mismatched painted wings, balanced on a fingertip.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4d. The Dancing Fire|Manuscript callout in C4d]]","x":860,"y":1970,"width":620,"height":290},
		{"id":"game-checks","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: guessing is not a truth detector\nPlayers guess first. On a requested Insight check, use the base **DC 15** for either unnamed teller or **DC 20** for another story, then add **+1 per Insight check that player has requested during this game** (including this request). Track each player's requests separately; one player's checks do not affect another's DC. Success reveals only whether a **material falsehood** exists, not exact category/detail.\n\nA falsehood must matter, not merely change an age. Encourage half-true tellers to explain; do not force Arturi to disclose.\n\nTrack guesses/winner; pot includes listed wagers only.","x":1500,"y":1970,"width":620,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"game-vistana-rider","type":"text","text":"### First unnamed Vistana\n**Flexible interlude during game, not a fixed late turn.**\n\nMatter-of-fact witness: skeletal rider, skeletal horse, broken lantern; stood aside rather than followed.\n\n**True encounter.** Rider as guide is only rumor.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#The Two Vistani's Tales|Brief tale]]","x":860,"y":2290,"width":300,"height":350},
		{"id":"game-vistana-cake","type":"text","text":"### Second unnamed Vistana\n**Flexible interlude during game.**\n\nSkeptical about rider rumors; then tells of a wedding pig stealing cake, found sleeping under a wagon.\n\n**False:** wedding, pig, cake all invented.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#The Two Vistani's Tales|Brief tale]]","x":1180,"y":2290,"width":300,"height":350},
		{"id":"game-voting","type":"text","text":"### During PC stories: NPC guesses\n**Stanimir:** always True.\n**Eliza:** alternate True / False.\n**Arturi:** alternate Half-True / False.\n**Ireena:** alternate True / Half-True.\n\nPlayers go first on guesses. Later tale-specific votes override these default patterns.","x":1500,"y":2290,"width":620,"height":270},
		{"id":"game-elga-dream","type":"text","text":"### IF Elga mentions the Abbot's fire dream\nStanimir answers with a Vistani story; Eliza treats it as fear, not knowledge about them. Neither explains Ferd's vision or discusses Vistani curses.\n\nElga can remain silent. Do not announce a dream connection for her.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4d. The Dancing Fire|Fire tie-in]]","x":1500,"y":2590,"width":620,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tales-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":3020,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tales-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":3020,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tales-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":3020,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tales-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":3020,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tales-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":3020,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tales-time","type":"text","text":"### Stories unfold\nStanimir's tale has no required PC count.\n\n**Eliza:** after one PC.\n\n**Arturi:** after three PCs.\n\n**Ireena:** after all PCs.\n\nInterleave, don't read four NPC tales consecutively.","x":40,"y":3110,"width":180,"height":460},
		{"id":"tales-fire","type":"text","text":"### Stanimir's flame images\nQuiet incantation, wine, green fire.\n\nWounded soldier; pursuit; mutual protection; promise of sanctuary. Figures disperse into smoke/embers.\n\n**DM:** major image; players can notice him shaping the illusion.","x":480,"y":3110,"width":360,"height":290},
		{"id":"tales-stanimir","type":"text","text":"### Stanimir | wounded prince\nDisplaced Vistani shelter a wounded stranger and escort him home through hostile territory. He fights beside them and promises safety and freedom to leave.\n\n**Reveal after guesses:** True. If asked, identifies the prince as Strahd before Barovia.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#Stanimir’s Tale|Full tale / incantation]]","x":860,"y":3110,"width":620,"height":280},
		{"id":"tales-stanimir-alert","type":"text","text":"### Guesses / spotlight\nAfter players: **Ireena True; Eliza True; Arturi Half-True.** Actual: **True**.\n\nGrim is looking for a prince from her sign. Notice her response without confirming unrelated interpretations.\n\nSame Urn/Blood Sense conditions as the fire roster; recheck anyone entering/leaving range.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q23, C4d]]","x":1500,"y":3110,"width":620,"height":280},
		{"id":"tales-eliza","type":"text","text":"### Eliza | after one PC | Lugdana\nQuiet, melodic telling: Morninglord's champion, Ravenkind's Symbol, Chernovog at Yester Hill, victory and mortal wound, raven angel reclaiming the gift.\n\n**Reveal:** Half-True. Paladin and relic are real; the angel is legend, the relic's fate unknown to the tellers.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#Eliza’s Tale|Full tale]]","x":860,"y":3430,"width":620,"height":280},
		{"id":"tales-eliza-alert","type":"text","text":"### Guesses / knowledge boundary\n**Ireena Half-True; Stanimir True; Arturi False.** Actual: **Half-True**.\n\nDo not give Vistani DM-only knowledge of Livius, the Sigil's theft, Baba Zelenna, or the Symbol's current location. They can repeat the tale and its clarification.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q27/Q28, C4d]]","x":1500,"y":3430,"width":620,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tales-arturi","type":"text","text":"### Arturi | after three PCs | animal fable\nFox fails to save Sparrows' chick. Sparrows steal his kit and give it to Wolf. Fox enlists Rats; the flock pays for six culprits. One chick may remain, still hunted.\n\n**Reveal:** True. Sad, guarded; declines explanation.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#Arturi’s Tale|Full tale]]","x":860,"y":3750,"width":620,"height":280},
		{"id":"tales-arturi-alert","type":"text","text":"### Guesses / secret allegory\n**Ireena Half-True; Stanimir True; Eliza False.** Actual: **True**.\n\n**DM-only:** do not explain the Van Richten/Radanavich connection as player knowledge. Azalin supplying undead is accepted lore, not a public answer Arturi gives here.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4c. Vistani Hospitality|Backstory]]","x":1500,"y":3750,"width":620,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tales-ireena","type":"text","text":"### Ireena | after all PCs | childhood dream\nLake with father/brother; huge wolf; flight through thorns; mist-wolf lunges; wakes in bed to father's humming.\n\n**Reveal:** False as a lived event; a recurring childhood dream. Stanimir allows dreams a grain of truth.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#Ireena’s Tale|Full tale]]","x":860,"y":4070,"width":620,"height":270},
		{"id":"tales-ireena-alert","type":"text","text":"### Guesses / close the game\n**Stanimir True; Eliza False; Arturi False.** Actual: **False**.\n\nKeep the dream distinct from established childhood history. No forced PC recognition or reaction.\n\nResolve remaining guesses and the pot, then Arturi's departure. Do not let NPC delivery displace the PCs' own stories.","x":1500,"y":4070,"width":620,"height":270},
		{"id":"arturi-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":4520,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arturi-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":4520,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arturi-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":4520,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arturi-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":4520,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arturi-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":4520,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arturi-time","type":"text","text":"### After the game\nIF followed: time from his arrival at decoy site:\n\n**+30 min:** 12 zombies.\n\n**2h later:** 5 ghouls.\n\n**2h later:** 3 ghasts.\n\n**2h later:** 4 wights.\n\nVanish into woods shortly before dawn.","x":40,"y":4610,"width":180,"height":530},
		{"id":"arturi-location","type":"text","text":"### IF party investigates\nTwo miles from camp: decoy among tall tree boughs. Arturi hides/sleeps elsewhere in forest.\n\nNot a mandatory detour. The undead gather at the decoy, not at an inexplicably safe man in a tree.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#Arturi Departs|Branch source]]","x":480,"y":4610,"width":360,"height":300},
		{"id":"arturi-npc","type":"text","text":"### Arturi | farewell\nSad smile; lingering endangers the camp. Refuses offers to defend him and slips away.\n\n**DC 12 Charisma (Persuasion):** admits undead pursue him nightly and have for eighteen years; a man's vow bound him. No further explanation.\n\nThe camp treats him with wary compassion, not blame.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#C4c. Vistany Hospitality|Q10, Section 3]]","x":860,"y":4610,"width":620,"height":300},
		{"id":"arturi-alert-senses","type":"text","text":"### SENSES: departure / IF followed\n**Elga's Urn glows: tell the player** as soon as any of the gathering undead enters 300 ft. No preset glow at camp from creatures two miles away.\n\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Arturi/living companions register only while within 30 ft; track departure and hiding positions. Undead do not register.\n\nApply the guide's stage/HP reporting, not a false claim Arturi is undead.","x":1500,"y":4610,"width":620,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arturi-alert-clock","type":"text","text":"### IF this detour competes with midnight\nTrack actual travel and elapsed time; the gathering is a relative sequence, not a promise the party sees every wave before the reading.\n\nDo not advance six hours merely because these entries share one card. Return to the main road sequence when the party does.","x":1500,"y":4940,"width":620,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"road-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":5340,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"road-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":5340,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"road-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":5340,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"road-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":5340,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"road-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":5340,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"road-time","type":"text","text":"### Toward midnight\nRoad: **1.5 miles / 30 minutes**.\n\nKnown appointment, not an audible clock.\n\n**DM:** Neyavr 1 rolls to Neyavr 2 at midnight (prep decision).\n\nAllow actual detours.","x":40,"y":5430,"width":180,"height":430},
		{"id":"road-weather","type":"text","text":"### Cold, moonless night\n- Night cold on exposed skin.\n- New moon; no moonlight through mist.\n- Air grows eerily still; leaves stop rustling.\n\nNo new weather penalty.","x":240,"y":5430,"width":220,"height":310},
		{"id":"road-location","type":"text","text":"### Leaving the fire behind\n- Gnarled branches loom over muddy road.\n- **OPTIONAL ATMOSPHERE:** smell of wet earth and sodden leaves.\n- Boots squelch; other sounds fall away.\n\n**IF followed and noticed:** snapped twig; bush rustles, then stillness.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#Traveling to the Crossroads|Journey and Eliza branches]]","x":480,"y":5430,"width":360,"height":350},
		{"id":"road-eliza","type":"text","text":"### Eliza | shadowing the party\nCalled to: stays hidden/silent. Found: hands raised, professes harmless curiosity; wants to accompany them.\n\nRefused: appears to return but loops back to follow tracks. **DC 15 Charisma (Intimidation)** persuades her pursuit is fruitless: stays at Tser Pool.\n\nThreatened: surrenders; **DC 15 Intimidation** reveals she reports to the castle's lord. Loyalty is her fanaticism, not a belief shared by all Vistani.","x":860,"y":5430,"width":620,"height":340},
		{"id":"road-eliza-attack","type":"text","text":"### IF attacked | Eliza flees\nEscapes toward Castle Ravenloft; does not return to camp that night.\n\n**If this is the one chase:** DMG wilderness chase; midges use wasp swarm stats, stampede is elk, indigenous creature is giant spider.\n\nCover from pursuer **30+ ft: half; 60+ ft: three-quarters**.\n\nIf wolf chase already occurred, do not start a second chase. The approved non-chase resolution remains **OPEN PREP**.\n\n[[assets/Dungeon Master's Guide#Chases|2014 chase procedure]]","x":860,"y":5800,"width":620,"height":420},
		{"id":"road-alert-follow","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: following and off-road branch\nConceal departure: **DC 11 Dexterity (Stealth)** or other covert action. If not concealed, **passive Perception 11+** notices being followed.\n\nConceal tracks off-road: **DC 11 Dexterity (Stealth), then DC 11 Wisdom (Survival)**. This triggers the vision branch below; it does not automatically remove Eliza.\n\n**At most one chase:** wolf pursuit OR pursuit of Eliza. Otherwise skip vision band and continue to crossroads.","x":1500,"y":5430,"width":620,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"road-alert-senses","type":"text","text":"### SENSES: hidden does not mean undetectable\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Eliza is living: exact location/HP state if within **30 ft**, even behind a bush. Range unknown: measure, track entry/exit. Include Ireena, raven, other living companions; living chase complications if encountered within range.\n\nDo not hide that information to preserve the twig reveal, and do not identify her from Blood Sense alone.\n\n**Urn:** no actual undead introduced on this road/Eliza branch. Check again approaching the crossroads; the March starts later.","x":1500,"y":5800,"width":620,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"vision-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":6480,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"vision-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":6480,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"vision-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":6480,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"vision-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs / apparent threats","x":860,"y":6480,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"vision-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":6480,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"vision-time","type":"text","text":"### IF off-road\nBrief escalation, not a scheduled encounter.\n\nChase intended **2-3 rounds**, not guaranteed.\n\nActual movement and resources persist.","x":40,"y":6570,"width":180,"height":300},
		{"id":"vision-location","type":"text","text":"### 180 ft from crossroads\nLeaves rustle in several directions; eyes multiply; growls encircle.\n\nLeave a real traversable escape route. Wolf begins **60 ft behind rearmost PC**.\n\nOnly one enormous pursuer acts; surrounding pack is presentation.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Q38 - Off-road wolf-pack vision (DM-only)|Approved Q38 mechanics]]","x":480,"y":6570,"width":360,"height":380},
		{"id":"vision-wolf","type":"text","text":"### Apparent enormous wolf | DM-only proxy\n**Objective:** escape or respond decisively; not an HP race. Pursues nearest straggler; respects faster PCs and successful interference.\n\nTyrannosaurus proxy, Bite only: Huge; AC **13**, HP **136** if needed; speed **50 ft**, initiative **+0**, passive Perception **14**; Bite **+10**, reach **10 ft**.\n\nNo Tail/Multiattack. No free Bite after Dashing. Background pack gets no turns.","x":860,"y":6570,"width":620,"height":350},
		{"id":"vision-alert-cut","type":"text","text":"### CRITICAL: cut before phantom harm\nIf wolf can attack with action available: roll attack and honor reactions; end vision on resolution, **hit or miss**, before damage, grapple, restraint, or wounds.\n\nSuccessful counters matter; no blanket immunity or forced hit. Counter/early-end adjudication remains **OPEN PREP**.\n\nEnd at real location. No teleportation/reuniting split PCs. At crossroads, pursuit ends for that PC; track remaining participants. Real costs remain.","x":1500,"y":6570,"width":620,"height":350,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"vision-brush","type":"text","text":"### One mapped brush obstacle\n**DC 10 Strength (Athletics) OR Dexterity (Acrobatics)**, player's choice.\n\nFail: brush counts as **5 ft of difficult terrain**. Same terrain affects the wolf.\n\nQ38 adaptation replaces random complications; use existing confirmed map, not a new hazard.","x":480,"y":6980,"width":360,"height":300},
		{"id":"vision-rules","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: chase quick reference\nInitiative normally; track everyone separately. Dash spends action unless a feature says otherwise; no normal opportunity attacks between chase participants.\n\nFree Dashes: **3 + Con modifier**; thereafter end-turn **DC 10 Constitution check** or 1 exhaustion. Wolf: **7 free**.\n\nEnd-round quarry Stealth: auto-fail if never out of lead pursuer's sight; otherwise must exceed **passive 14** here. Apply DMG escape factors; woods alone do not guarantee escape.\n\nCrossroads exit ends that character's pursuit (scene adaptation). Do not speed up wolf to erase good choices.\n\n[[assets/Dungeon Master's Guide#Running the Chase|Standard rules]] / [[assets/Dungeon Master's Guide#Ending a Chase|Escape factors]] / [[sessions/Session 9/prep#Q38 - Off-road wolf-pack vision (DM-only)|Scene adaptations]]","x":860,"y":6950,"width":620,"height":570},
		{"id":"vision-alert-senses","type":"text","text":"### SENSES: do not conceal the mismatch\n**Urn:** phantom wolves add no undead; no will-o'-wisp exists. Any actual undead within **300 ft** still trigger it: **Elga's Urn glows: tell the player**. Do not force it off for the vision.\n\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Apparitions are not living; no wolf detections even within 30 ft. Actual living companions and Eliza do register within range, including through cover. Report actual locations, bloodied status, lowest current HP; track entries/exits.\n\n**OPEN PREP:** real starting formation/HP and sense transitions; abrupt audio/visibility cut; non-chase Eliza follow-through if wolf chase used.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Blood Sense warnings|Q38/Q37 warning]]","x":1500,"y":6950,"width":620,"height":570,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"crossroads-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":7720,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"crossroads-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":7720,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"crossroads-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":7720,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"crossroads-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":7720,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"crossroads-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":7720,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"crossroads-time","type":"text","text":"### Midnight\n**DM:** Neyavr 2 now begins.\n\nMarch is the supernatural time cue; do not invent clock chimes.\n\nNo extra pre-March ghosts assumed.","x":40,"y":7810,"width":180,"height":300},
		{"id":"crossroads-weather","type":"text","text":"### Still, moonless\nFog among low headstones.\n\nFrayed gallows rope hangs motionless.\n\nNo breeze required to move the later candle shadows.","x":240,"y":7810,"width":220,"height":300},
		{"id":"crossroads-location","type":"text","text":"### Re-establish the forks\n**East:** Barovia Village.\n**Northwest/down:** Tser Pool.\n**Southwest/up:** Vallaki / Ravenloft.\n\nWeathered signpost; gallows opposite low-walled graveyard. Cloaked, squat silhouette waits.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#The March of the Dead|Crossroads scene]]","x":480,"y":7810,"width":360,"height":350},
		{"id":"crossroads-eva","type":"text","text":"### Madam Eva | waiting silhouette\nNo answer to calls; waits for approach. Asks what she told them before they left her tent.\n\nIf they forget, she reminds them: she knows them. Don't turn recall into a blocked scene.\n\nSolemn, concerned, opaque; wants Barovia freed.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q39, C4e]] / [[Appendices/Non-Player Characters#Madam Eva|Persona]]","x":860,"y":7810,"width":620,"height":350},
		{"id":"crossroads-eliza","type":"text","text":"### IF Eliza still follows\nHides in underbrush **north** of crossroads. Eva exposes her and demands she be stopped.\n\nEliza flees with **30-ft head start**. Escapes toward Ravenloft, not camp.\n\nIf captured, Eva demands her death and disposal in the Ivlis. This is an NPC demand, not a predetermined PC action.\n\n**If no earlier chase:** use Eliza chase card above. **If wolf chase used:** non-chase handling remains OPEN PREP.","x":860,"y":8200,"width":620,"height":370},
		{"id":"crossroads-alert-senses","type":"text","text":"### SENSES: before the March\n**Urn:** do not pre-trigger it merely for an unmanifested procession. Check other actual undead within **300 ft**.\n\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Eva, hidden Eliza, Ireena, raven, living companions within **30 ft**; north-bush distance not specified: measure before revealing. Same exact-location/HP reports and entry/exit tracking.\n\nSense detection can precede Eva noticing Eliza; do not withhold it.","x":1500,"y":7810,"width":620,"height":350,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"crossroads-alert-eliza","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: pursuit choices stay real\nOnly **one chase** on this return journey. If already spent on wolf, do not default to automatic capture, escape, or killing; flag the unfinished follow-through before play.\n\nEliza chase cover: **30+ ft half; 60+ ft three-quarters**. Wilderness complications: midges / elk / spider.\n\n**UNRESOLVED actor choice:** bandit in arc vs prepared Spy; confirm before using Cunning Action.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#The March of the Dead|Eliza's Flight]]","x":1500,"y":8200,"width":620,"height":370,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"crossroads-march-location","type":"text","text":"### March begins\nWan green light; spectral veterans, bowmen, dwarf, old-fashioned mages.\n\nSilent procession passes gallows, climbs southwest toward Ravenloft, swallowed by mist. No attention to onlookers.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#The March of the Dead|Description]]","x":480,"y":8610,"width":360,"height":390},
		{"id":"crossroads-march-eva","type":"text","text":"### Eva | invitation to face Strahd together\nAsks what the spirits share and where they go. Explain even if the party cannot answer: failed challengers, repeating their final quest.\n\nFate shows possibilities, not victory. Their signs were personal; this reading is for their common struggle.\n\nInvite their response; don't supply their resolve.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#The March of the Dead|Full speech]]","x":860,"y":8610,"width":620,"height":390},
		{"id":"crossroads-march-alert","type":"text","text":"### TELL PLAYER: Elga's Urn glows\n**Bright purple when spirits manifest within 300 ft.** Tell Elga immediately; track when procession leaves range.\n\nSpirits do not communicate and cannot be hit, damaged, or turned. Blood Sense detects no living procession; living onlookers still register within 30 ft if active.\n\n**Source override:** procession occurs at this crossroads graveyard, not source-book E6. No new interaction or soul-capture ruling invented.\n\n[[assets/Curse of Strahd#March of the Dead|Referenced spirit properties]]","x":1500,"y":8610,"width":620,"height":390,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"reading-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":9220,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"reading-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":9220,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"reading-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":9220,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"reading-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":9220,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"reading-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":9220,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"reading-time","type":"text","text":"### After the March\nNight of Neyavr 1, now **Neyavr 2**.\n\nReading duration is not fixed.\n\n**Future deadline:** Arabelle turns ten on **Neyavr 4**; deliver toy by noon.","x":40,"y":9310,"width":180,"height":390},
		{"id":"reading-location-setup","type":"text","text":"### Cemetery, not Eva's tent\nEva seats herself on earth; three candles, two decks, velvet pouch.\n\n**TABLE:** short break; small table, safe existing lights, cards, discreet paper script. Accessibility first.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Q45 - Immersive Tarokka reading|Staging notes]]","x":480,"y":9310,"width":360,"height":330},
		{"id":"reading-eva-task","type":"text","text":"### Eva | a boon for a boon\n**10 gp** to buy Arabelle a toy at **Blinsky Toys, Vallaki**. Deliver to Vistani camp **southwest of Vallaki**, by **noon Neyavr 4**. Keep the change.\n\nArabelle is her great-grand-niece. If asked: Luvash is father/camp leader; Arrigal his perceptive brother.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4f. The Tarokka Reading|Full reading / task]]","x":860,"y":9310,"width":620,"height":330},
		{"id":"reading-alert-task","type":"text","text":"### IF they decline the task: no reading\nAccepted Q46 decision: Eva withholds the reading. Do not assume acceptance or reveal the cards anyway.\n\nProceed below only if they accept. No new refusal outcome invented.\n\n**SENSES:** no new undead introduced; recheck actual March proximity for Urn. Agni: living Eva/companions within 30 ft if active; seating/range/HP must be tracked.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q46/Q47, C4f]]","x":1500,"y":9310,"width":620,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"reading-location-open","type":"text","text":"### World falls away\nCandle flames dim crimson; surrounding sound fades to silence. Headstone shadows lean toward cards despite still air.\n\nDescribe changes; no real flashing lights, smoke, or sudden darkness needed.","x":480,"y":9680,"width":360,"height":290},
		{"id":"reading-eva-deal","type":"text","text":"### Eva | deal face down\nSeparate **14 high cards** from **40 common**. Keep prepared order; do not shuffle away the fixed draws.\n\nCommon: **left, top, right**. High: **bottom, center**.\n\nPause, meaning, turn, prophecy, silence. Use exact source text when speaking clues.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Tarokka Deck|Deck handling / selected order]]","x":860,"y":9680,"width":620,"height":290},
		{"id":"reading-alert-script","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: full words, not cue paraphrases\nThe five rows below are delivery/meaning cues, **not substitute prophecy text**. Open the full C4f script and cited original foretellings.\n\nSource-linked DM meanings stay hidden. Give players written prophecies afterward without explanations.\n\nNo obligatory closed eyes or touching; safe light and audibility take priority.","x":1500,"y":9680,"width":620,"height":290,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"reading-light-traitor","type":"text","text":"### 1 | Deep blue\nLeft card: guardsman conceals dagger from a priest.\n\nQuiet focus on the first reveal.","x":480,"y":10010,"width":360,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-traitor","type":"text","text":"### Eva | 1. Traitor | left\n**Nine of Glyphs.** Measured, searching; head tilted as if listening.\n\nHistory / knowledge. Ancient foe, noble house, lost soul.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4f. The Tarokka Reading|Speak exact modified prophecy]]","x":860,"y":10010,"width":620,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-traitor-secret","type":"text","text":"### DM meaning: Tome\nLeo Dilisnya's gallows speaker; House Wachter; Stella is the lost soul.\n\nNot Lady Wachter's chest. Do not explain the solution during the reading.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Tarokka Deck|DM meanings 1]]","x":1500,"y":10010,"width":620,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"reading-light-myrmidon","type":"text","text":"### 2 | Warm yellow\nTop card: armored warrior, cracked sword, wooden shield.\n\nAllow warmth into the delivery.","x":480,"y":10260,"width":360,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-myrmidon","type":"text","text":"### Eva | 2. Myrmidon | top\n**Five of Swords.** Reassuring.\n\nGood / protection / holy symbol. Wolves' den, mountain lake, Mother Night.\n\n[[assets/Curse of Strahd#Swords (Spades)|Speak Five of Swords foretelling]]","x":860,"y":10260,"width":620,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-myrmidon-secret","type":"text","text":"### DM meaning: Holy Symbol\nMother Night's shrine, **Z7 werewolf den**; Zuleika controls access.\n\nDo not reveal those identifiers unless the prophecy actually names them.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Tarokka Deck|DM meanings 2]]","x":1500,"y":10260,"width":620,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"reading-light-bishop","type":"text","text":"### 3 | Fierce white\nRight card: holy vestments, smoking censer.\n\nDescribe the flare; don't shine a light in players' eyes.","x":480,"y":10510,"width":360,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-bishop","type":"text","text":"### Eva | 3. Bishop | right\n**Eight of Glyphs.** Sit straighter; firm, purposeful.\n\nWeapon / vengeance / sunlight. Amber prison; house of fallen dragon leads there.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4f. The Tarokka Reading|Speak exact modified prophecy]]","x":860,"y":10510,"width":620,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-bishop-secret","type":"text","text":"### DM meaning: Sunsword\nHidden by Patrina in a demiplane within the Vampyr's prison, Amber Temple. Route clue: Argynvostholt.\n\nNo extra explanation to players.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Tarokka Deck|DM meanings 3]]","x":1500,"y":10510,"width":620,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"reading-light-mists","type":"text","text":"### 4 | Violet embers\nBottom card: fog-choked graveyard, iron fence.\n\nTwilit glow beyond the candles.","x":480,"y":10760,"width":360,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-mists","type":"text","text":"### Eva | 4. Mists | bottom\n**High deck.** Lean closer; contemplative, quiet.\n\nAn ally: lone Vistana seeking mentor; Saint Markovia's abbey.\n\n[[assets/Curse of Strahd#Strahd's Enemy|Speak Mists foretelling]]","x":860,"y":10760,"width":620,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-mists-secret","type":"text","text":"### DM meaning: ally\nEzmerelda d'Avenir, searching for Van Richten; meet near Krezk at the abbey.\n\nVan Richten is the mentor, not the foretold ally.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Tarokka Deck|DM meanings 4]]","x":1500,"y":10760,"width":620,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"reading-light-marionette","type":"text","text":"### 5 | Darkness crowds in\nCenter card: crowned ruler with puppet limbs; strings vanish overhead.\n\nLongest hesitation; no jump scare.","x":480,"y":11010,"width":360,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-marionette","type":"text","text":"### Eva | 5. Marionette | center\n**High deck.** Hand stops short; trembles. Lowest clearly audible voice.\n\nFinal confrontation: great heights, castle's beating heart.\n\n[[assets/Curse of Strahd#Strahd's Location in the Castle|Speak Marionette foretelling]]","x":860,"y":11010,"width":620,"height":210},
		{"id":"reading-marionette-secret","type":"text","text":"### DM meaning: Strahd's location\n**K60, North Tower Peak**, near Heart of Sorrow.\n\nNot Pidlwick II or an additional ally.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#Tarokka Deck|DM meanings 5]]","x":1500,"y":11010,"width":620,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"reading-end-location","type":"text","text":"### Ordinary world returns\nCandles crimson again. Wind in trees, distant owl, river lapping.\n\nLet reactions breathe; restore optional ambience only if easy to control.","x":480,"y":11260,"width":360,"height":220},
		{"id":"reading-end-eva","type":"text","text":"### Eva | recovery and dismissal\nRecoil, recover, silently regard them. No elaboration or extra assistance. Return to Tser Pool; keep reading from Strahd's servants.\n\nEva stays for private memories. If they return later, she has vanished. Her mother's nearby grave is **DM-only**, not volunteered.","x":860,"y":11260,"width":620,"height":220},
		{"id":"reading-end-alert","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: milestone on departure\nAfter reading **and departing crossroads**, award **500 XP each**. Accepted running total: **1,400 -> 1,900**, not level 4 (2,700).\n\nIf no reading, don't award its milestone. Recheck Urn range/Blood Sense as procession and companions move.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q49, C4f]]","x":1500,"y":11260,"width":620,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"morning-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":11660,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"morning-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":11660,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"morning-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":11660,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"morning-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":11660,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"morning-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":11660,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"morning-time","type":"text","text":"### STRETCH\nFollowing morning: **Neyavr 2**, not Neyavr 3 merely because sleep followed midnight.\n\n**DM reference:** sunrise 07:00. Don't assume waking exactly then.\n\n[[Chapter 2 - The Land of Barovia/Lore of Barovia#Weather|Day length]]","x":40,"y":11750,"width":180,"height":390},
		{"id":"morning-weather","type":"text","text":"### Morning light\nOnly describe daylight if it has actually arrived.\n\n**OPTIONAL ATMOSPHERE:** pale grey light behind mist; no promise of clear skies.","x":240,"y":11750,"width":220,"height":280},
		{"id":"morning-location","type":"text","text":"### Cold campfire\nDreamed more than ever; no recall of the dreams.\n\nBreakfast: cornmeal polenta, stuffed cabbage, fried bread.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C4g. Departing Tser Pool|C4g source]]","x":480,"y":11750,"width":360,"height":280},
		{"id":"morning-npcs","type":"text","text":"### Breakfast company | simultaneous\n**Stanimir:** invites them to breakfast. **Arturi:** attends if able. **Eliza:** cheerful company only if her treachery wasn't revealed; check whether she actually returned.\n\n**Eva:** asleep on pallet; Stanimir asks they not disturb her. If they wait, accepted note: tired from reading, cannot help again for a while.\n\n[[sessions/Session 9/prep#3. Resolved and adapted (lock)|Q50/Q51, C4g]]","x":860,"y":11750,"width":620,"height":390},
		{"id":"morning-alert","type":"text","text":"### CHECK: morning features / aftermath\nAgni loses **Blood Hunter level TP at dawn**. Recalculate stage; do not assume yesterday's Blood Sense activation persists.\n\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Living breakfast company, raven/companions, Eva in tent if within **30 ft** even through canvas. Measure actual layout, report exact locations/HP, track entry/exit.\n\n**Urn:** no new undead introduced; recheck real creatures within **300 ft**. PCs excluded.\n\n[[players/agni/vampire_details#Thirst|Dawn rule]]\n**OPEN PREP:** do not mark rehearsals complete because this board exists.","x":1500,"y":11750,"width":620,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rider-h-time","type":"text","text":"## Time","x":40,"y":12460,"width":180,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rider-h-weather","type":"text","text":"## Weather","x":240,"y":12460,"width":220,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rider-h-location","type":"text","text":"## Location","x":480,"y":12460,"width":360,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rider-h-npcs","type":"text","text":"## NPCs","x":860,"y":12460,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rider-h-alerts","type":"text","text":"## DM alerts","x":1500,"y":12460,"width":620,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"rider-time","type":"text","text":"### STRETCH trigger\nReturn to crossroads **after reading**.\n\nUsually onward after breakfast; if party doubles back earlier, jump here then. Not intrinsically a sunrise encounter.\n\nC6 remains outside this board.","x":40,"y":12550,"width":180,"height":540},
		{"id":"rider-location","type":"text","text":"### Figure through mist\nApproaches from west; continues toward Barovia Village.\n\nTorn, raked muddy leather; horse has bit/bridle, no saddle/bags. Broken lantern.\n\n**IF not taken earlier:** copper compass catches light.\n\n[[Act I - Into the Mists/Arc C - Into the Valley#C5. The Skeletal Rider|C5 source]]","x":480,"y":12550,"width":360,"height":370},
		{"id":"rider-npc","type":"text","text":"### Skeletal rider / horse\nIgnore living travelers unless attacked. If party saw Dalvan's corpse, clothing is recognizably similar; don't assert recognition without that history.\n\n**IF followed:** soon turns south onto old hunting path, then east toward border; no particular destination. No adopted guide/rescue mission.\n\nThe fire tale foreshadowed the sight; its claims about guiding the lost remain rumor.\n\n[[assets/Curse of Strahd#Skeletal Rider|Referenced behavior]]","x":860,"y":12550,"width":620,"height":370},
		{"id":"rider-alert","type":"text","text":"### TELL PLAYER: Elga's Urn glows\nRider **or** skeletal horse within **300 ft**: bright purple immediately, even before visual reveal if range permits. Track approach/departure.\n\n**Agni's Blood Sense: check thirst stage/activation; tell the player if active.** Rider/horse are undead, no detections. Living Ireena/raven/companions still register if within **30 ft**; exact location/HP reporting and entry/exit as above.\n\n**IF attacked:** human skeleton + warhorse skeleton, not a forced fight. Use existing source statistics; do not turn an exploring rider concept into canon.\n\n[[players/sister_elga/soul_gathering#Urn of Soulcatching|Urn]] / [[players/agni/vampire_details#Blood Sense|Blood Sense]]","x":1500,"y":12550,"width":620,"height":580,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}